      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS BLUE BLAZE (1) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors five starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (17.33) at Casino over 300m. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Likely to feature again. RUSHFORTH BAZ (8) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the money last time though when second (20.47) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Expecting another good run. NINITA (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (20.46) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Can figure in the finish. KACHINA RIPPLE (6) can measure up with the right run.",
